sequenceDiagram
%% process-key: hotfix-rollout
    participant role_incident_commander as Incident commander
    participant role_platform_engineer as Platform engineer
    participant role_database_engineer as Database engineer
    participant role_qa_lead as QA lead
    participant role_release_approver as Release approver
    participant role_customer_liaison as Customer liaison
    participant system as Emergency hotfix rollout with shard-risk governance
    role_incident_commander->>system: Activate emergency bridge and classify severity
    system-->>role_incident_commander: evidence -> Emergency bridge activation log
    role_incident_commander->>system: Assess blast radius and rollback constraints
    system-->>role_incident_commander: evidence -> Blast-radius assessment
    role_platform_engineer->>system: Package emergency hotfix and rollback scripts
    system-->>role_platform_engineer: evidence -> Emergency patch and rollback bundle
    role_qa_lead->>system: Validate emergency fix in shadow environment
    system-->>role_qa_lead: evidence -> Emergency validation evidence pack
    role_incident_commander->>system: Approve emergency release window
    system-->>role_incident_commander: evidence -> Emergency release approval record
    role_platform_engineer->>system: Execute emergency rollout and watch telemetry
    system-->>role_platform_engineer: evidence -> Emergency rollout and telemetry log
    role_incident_commander->>system: Capture post-incident learning and corrective actions
    system-->>role_incident_commander: evidence -> Post-incident corrective action log
